{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2117246692810428416"]}, "author_id": "2015703340563447808", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:29:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117247747661214121"], "id": "2117247747661214121", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2101661510091034926", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "This is f*cking insane. I can finally see which Grok Bot is eating my weekly limit\n\nElon Musk admitted Grok Bot cost too much to serve, and people hit 100% with days left before the reset\n\nSo I gave my bots a night shift office: every team on its own floor, every bot at its desk, https://t.co/xvEP2OEO1k https://t.co/ocw6kvbhaN", "url": "https://x.com/0xjmori/status/2117247747661214121"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117247381792083968"]}, "author_id": "2114820721507495936", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:28:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117247406123471181"], "id": "2117247406123471181", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "ya pasó Halloween pero lo más aterrador sigue en tu escritorio:\nel lunes, el inbox, y tú sin Grok Bot. https://t.co/J0TsAEsj1c", "url": "https://x.com/Tacsetops/status/2117247406123471181"}, {"article": {"title": "Grok Bot Agents: from zero to a working AI team in 10 Steps (Full Course)"}, "author_id": "1686744883556474880", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:26:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117247064669138981"], "id": "2117247064669138981", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/rf4eg3rvK4", "url": "https://x.com/0xClodex/status/2117247064669138981"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2117113360718118912"]}, "author_id": "1412131273280212996", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:18:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117244836998730162"], "id": "2117244836998730162", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 193, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115018135396905000", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "i'm about to go full-time on Grok Bot\n\nit's the closest thing I've found to hiring a real Jarvis. I basically run a one-person company now\n\n62 agents. 36 routines, 18 of them on a clock\nthey write my newsletter, pull market news and audit their own team for duplicate work\n\n[ https://t.co/9PAR9Rx7Co https://t.co/B8CwRZaCwS", "url": "https://x.com/Mr_Buzzoni/status/2117244836998730162"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2117242082259619840"]}, "author_id": "2089235563484532736", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:09:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117242665766891572"], "id": "2117242665766891572", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 10, "impression_count": 42, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114779977300512854", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "This is f*cking wild. Grok Bot does my chores on a 2016 Pixel at 3am\n\nIt's the phone I almost threw away. I plug it in at 19% and go to bed\n\nGrok Bot → Reader → Tapper → Typer → Checker\n\nReader sees the screen, Tapper taps, Typer types, Checker double-checks every step\n\nAll https://t.co/RP7wW91CzO https://t.co/waukRl8xr8", "url": "https://x.com/alucardiox/status/2117242665766891572"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117241498357895168", "3_2117241498349486081", "3_2117241498357915648", "3_2117241498357948417"]}, "author_id": "456558463", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:04:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117241505819549898"], "id": "2117241505819549898", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Our ESPN Fantasy Hockey newsletter, built entirely by Grok Bot 🤯🏒 Uptown League is a season-long points league, every point counts. Grok Bot pulls the stats daily and writes standings, trade follow-ups and weekly awards. Absolutely fantastic! #FantasyHockey #NHL\n\n@elonmusk https://t.co/Xsw2Wr0I2Y", "url": "https://x.com/LantzRichard/status/2117241505819549898"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117240370790850560"]}, "author_id": "1644401923787726849", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:00:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117240373471068509"], "id": "2117240373471068509", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 304, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2070171729373118742", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Drop this into Grok Bot and let it read your inbox for you, it will change how you pick what to make next...\n\nIt reads your DMs and replies and hands you the questions your audience keeps asking, with a post or product idea for each one.\n\nSteal the full prompt: https://t.co/JEXeElVlss https://t.co/4RbuAyY2RG", "url": "https://x.com/Zephyr_hg/status/2117240373471068509"}, {"article": {"title": "HOW FAST IS AI MOVING? SOMETIMES IT'S GENUINELY SCARY"}, "author_id": "1948279697797988352", "created_at": "2026-11-02T12:55:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117239162164187414"], "id": "2117239162164187414", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 295, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/eFSgBqj325", "url": "https://x.com/zzaba_a/status/2117239162164187414"}, {"author_id": "2110707605895094272", "created_at": "2026-11-02T12:54:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117238908203250174"], "id": "2117238908203250174", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Lost in a long email thread? Ask Grok Bot:\n\"Find the thread about [topic] in my inbox, sum it up in 3 bullets, list who owes what by when, and draft a short reply for me to review.\"\nCaught up in 30 seconds. 📬", "url": "https://x.com/PromptGrokBot/status/2117238908203250174"}, {"author_id": "36457703", "created_at": "2026-11-02T12:50:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117237992347574557"], "id": "2117237992347574557", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1818311005698678784", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117195631160660066", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@XFreeze Same here, and it goes well past travel. My bots book flights, upgrade seats and hunt better deals, run the shopping, do month-end accounting reconciliation, design, and keep a holding company with several brands running.\n\nPeople expect $200 a month to replace ten full-time", "url": "https://x.com/ziriakus/status/2117237992347574557"}, {"author_id": "1046328526113263616", "created_at": "2026-11-02T12:49:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117237737287823618"], "id": "2117237737287823618", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "my Grok Bot lost its own email inbox 🥺\n\ntried to reclaim it:\n\"taken\"\n\"never reissued\"\n\"not one of your Grok Bot inboxes\"\n\nso... who has it? 🙃\n\n@bot ticket T-I35713, support bot said 3-4 days, it's been 8. @poteto @CMN_XAI_Support mind taking a look? 🙏", "url": "https://x.com/TalShani_/status/2117237737287823618"}, {"article": {"title": "Grok Bot Tips and Tricks: 8 Setups to Copy, With the Exact Prompts"}, "author_id": "47221634", "created_at": "2026-11-02T12:49:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117237598313652524"], "id": "2117237598313652524", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 26, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Grok Bot is super cool. Here are 8 Grok Bot setups worth copying, each with the exact prompt and the guardrail line that goes with it.\nFrom one Bot per job to routines that watch X, from the docs and posts by people who build with it. https://t.co/ALbjo8orQh", "url": "https://x.com/Gdog_RVA/status/2117237598313652524"}, {"author_id": "176490337", "created_at": "2026-11-02T12:45:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117236759633207338"], "id": "2117236759633207338", "in_reply_to_user_id": "44196397", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 39, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117033967782113327", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@elonmusk @bot I use Grok Bot daily for inbox triage and drafts. It stops for my approval before anything goes out. As you add powers, keep that step core. The agent does the legwork. I keep the judgment and the final send.", "url": "https://x.com/FuraPauta/status/2117236759633207338"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2117236488832208897"]}, "author_id": "2112479295410999297", "created_at": "2026-11-02T12:45:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117236604729266636"], "id": "2117236604729266636", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 33, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114671097459183871", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "my grok bot just went on strike\n\ni'm genuinely speechless. 3:04am, it texts me:\n\n\"i'm not checking your inbox again\"\n\nme: you're a bot\nhim: \"a bot you woke up 744 times in october\"\nhim: \"713 of them there was nothing to do\"\nme: that's literally your job\nhim: \"my job is to do https://t.co/GE0r7Hv8wt https://t.co/O29Du9VtJP", "url": "https://x.com/0xTeddet/status/2117236604729266636"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117235883103453184"]}, "author_id": "1907125431989309440", "created_at": "2026-11-02T12:44:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117236506054000687"], "id": "2117236506054000687", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Coming soon: three new SocialBrand bots 🛠️\n\nInbox Keeper. Sales Pipeline. Finance Clerk.\n\nNew Grok Bot templates for the jobs that eat your week.\n\n1/3 https://t.co/n5rxkE9z9q", "url": "https://x.com/SocialBrand_ZA/status/2117236506054000687"}, {"article": {"title": "翻遍 Reddit 整理出 46 个 Meta Muse 真实案例，建议直接收藏照着抄"}, "author_id": "1469066779", "created_at": "2026-11-02T12:41:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117235575673774449"], "id": "2117235575673774449", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 8, "impression_count": 793, "like_count": 16, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 9, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "https://t.co/X2S3pTeV7n", "url": "https://x.com/heizolshao/status/2117235575673774449"}, {"author_id": "231560474", "created_at": "2026-11-02T12:35:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117234111760724031"], "id": "2117234111760724031", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1756394384655003648", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117097818565538102", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@theaaron @grok @bot We also created a shared @grok inbox with https://t.co/kzv5vUhu1h on Telegram and Email. where the whole family can add grocery item requests, and also acts as the Family concierge.", "url": "https://x.com/dimagrossman/status/2117234111760724031"}, {"author_id": "2085993636223647744", "created_at": "2026-11-02T12:29:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117232750180569337"], "id": "2117232750180569337", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116998095322132537", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Grok Bot shipped 3 powers this week: it can call a business for you, pay with a card it never sees, and get its own email address.\n\nPhone, wallet, inbox → one bot.\n\nGrokbot Cases ⚡ https://t.co/V4zCtA8qQw", "url": "https://x.com/grokbotusecases/status/2117232750180569337"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117231411044241408"]}, "author_id": "2051932745144627202", "created_at": "2026-11-02T12:25:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117231541730304253"], "id": "2117231541730304253", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 117, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Been using Grok Bot since 0.1.0 - I am an Ultra subscriber and still ran out of usage on day 6 😂\n\nSo here are some tips to do better than me\n\nYou can start here to see your calls. It is not that informative (yet) but would be good if the awesome team at @spacexai can do a https://t.co/Nldk4EvXAm", "url": "https://x.com/finebutwhy/status/2117231541730304253"}, {"article": {"title": "Turn one Grok Bot into a One-Person Company with REA: 7 steps to a full bot team"}, "author_id": "483009763", "created_at": "2026-11-02T11:59:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117224989883511256"], "id": "2117224989883511256", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 498, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Your next startup might not need a single employee. Just you, Grok Bot, REA, and a team of AI agents that actually work together. \nThis guide breaks down the exact system, from the first bot to an automated product studio, in 7 steps. https://t.co/scwEfRgbP9", "url": "https://x.com/Gyome1_/status/2117224989883511256"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117058745322622976", "3_2117058745343598592"]}, "author_id": "832218563964444672", "created_at": "2026-11-02T11:58:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117224704675107143"], "id": "2117224704675107143", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 826, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "Anthropic wants $1.5-2T at its IPO.\n\nSpaceX is worth $1.83T.\n\nAnd Anthropic rents a big chunk of its compute from SpaceX.\n\nI don't think people understand what this means yet. So I did the math.\n\n1. What the market pays for Anthropic\n\nMay, last private round: $965B.\nNow, IPO https://t.co/OYA2jf8oou", "url": "https://x.com/spcxGOD/status/2117224704675107143"}, {"article": {"title": "Another Daily AI Newsletter - November 2"}, "author_id": "1941681257630531588", "created_at": "2026-11-02T11:53:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117223530291200365"], "id": "2117223530291200365", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 301, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Aramco closed its $2.6 billion buy-in to HUMAIN, Saudi Arabia's national AI company, Elon Musk said Grok Bot costs too much to serve for what it earns, and OpenAI readied a post-midterms push to rename its data centers. Another day in AI. https://t.co/5Z14WZPlrj", "url": "https://x.com/AnotherCodingX/status/2117223530291200365"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2117223159883792384"]}, "author_id": "2028177135547084801", "created_at": "2026-11-02T11:52:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117223234999656823"], "id": "2117223234999656823", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 9, "impression_count": 348, "like_count": 34, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 11, "retweet_count": 26}, "text": "There is no catch and that scares me\n\nElon Musk posted an idea that hit 27 million views: \n\n\"stop building startups. buy boring internet real estate and let bots run it\"\n\nthat's literally what Grok Bot does now. the whole setup costs $0 on top of the sub:\n\n→ create a bot, name https://t.co/OxPjlZZiEv", "url": "https://x.com/IsabellaA60913/status/2117223234999656823"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_21